# Game control. PDF page 4, printed page 2, block E.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
# ECDA, ESGA, E999, EPOG are analog boundary nodes (RC-loaded gate outputs).
chip G13 7402
chip K16 74112
chip K15 74112
chip L16 7408
chip J16 7404
chip L15 74112
chip J15 74112
chip H16 74161
# R5 pins 4/5 leads overlap in this drawing; output stubs 13/11/14 are T-bar
# terminated. Exidy Death Race DR-1A sheet E (3R) draws power-good clearly
# crossing ground to pin 5 and SECKS from pin 12; adopted here.
chip R5 74161
chip H15 7437
chip L14 74112
# K14 7407 open-collector outputs go to the sound board (sheet 17 amp inputs);
# K14.4 EPOG is the power-on RC buffer, modelled by the EPOG boundary input.
chip K14 7407
chip M16 7404

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net ECDR G13.1 K16.2
net ECDA G13.2 K16.3 BOARD
net 5ECDD G13.3 K15.6 L16.13
net 2TQ07 K16.1 J15.1
net E999 K16.4 K16.10 K15.4 K15.10 L15.4 J15.4 J15.10 H16.1 H16.9 R5.1 R5.5 L14.4 L14.10 BOARD
net ECDB K16.5 K16.11
net 5ECDB K16.6 K16.12
net EPOR K16.15 K16.14 K15.15 K15.14 L14.9 J16.13
net 1ECK0 K16.13 K15.1 K15.13 L15.1 J15.13 H15.8 L14.1 L14.13
net ECDC K16.9 K15.3 L16.12
net 5ECDC K16.7 K15.2
net NC K15.5 H16.11 R5.11 R5.13 R5.14 R5.15 L14.7
net ECDG L16.11 J16.11 L16.10 K15.11 L16.4 J15.2
net 5ECDG J16.10
net ECDE L16.8 L16.1
net 5ESGC L16.9 J15.7 J16.9
net STGO K15.12
net EGME K15.9 L16.2 L15.15 J15.15 J15.14 K14.1 BOARD
net 5EGME K15.7 M16.11
net E2PS L16.3 L15.3
net EP2R L16.6 L15.2
net ESGC L16.5 J15.9 BOARD
net E2PL L15.5 K14.13 BOARD
net 5E2PL L15.6
net ESGA J15.3 BOARD
net ESGB J15.5 J15.11
net 5ESGB J15.6 J15.12
net 1ESGC J16.8
net 6TQLC H16.2 R5.2
net TLC0 H16.7
net TLGZ H16.10
net 5ECK2 H16.12 H15.12 H15.13
net 5ECK1 H16.13
net 5ECK0 H16.14 H15.9 H15.10
net ECKC H16.15 R5.7 R5.10
net ACT3 R5.3
net GND R5.4 R5.6 L14.2
net 5ECKS R5.9 R5.12
net 1ECK2 H15.11 H15.4 H15.5
net 6ECK2 H15.6 H15.1 H15.2
net 2ECK2 H15.3
net EPOG L14.3 L14.15 L14.14 BOARD
net EPOS L14.5 L14.11
net 5EPOS L14.6 L14.12
net 6EPOR J16.12
net EGMC K14.2
net EHMC K14.12
net 4EGME M16.10
